# Build context excludes — keep the image small and never ship local state/secrets.
#
# The image is the website only (apps/site + the landing + the demo build), so the
# submodules are never needed: packages/ml carries ~300 MB of Git-LFS model weights and
# packages/pro is private. Both stay out of the context.
packages/ml
packages/pro
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-demo
**/.ssr-build
**/.turbo
release
apps/backend/data
apps/backend/.env
.env
.env.*
**/*.log
.git
.github
.claude
docs
*.md
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
